This project is a C#/.NET port of the git-diff-view project, with an Avalonia
rendering layer.

Portions of the design, parsing logic, algorithms, and behavior are based on or
derived from:

git-diff-view
Copyright (c) 2022 MrWangJustToDo
Licensed under the MIT License
https://github.com/MrWangJustToDo/git-diff-view

The diff parser ported through git-diff-view (Services/DiffParser.cs) originates
from GitHub Desktop:

desktop
Copyright (c) GitHub, Inc.
Licensed under the MIT License
https://github.com/desktop/desktop

The HTML escaping utility ported through git-diff-view (Utils/EscapeHtml.cs)
originates from the Vue.js core packages/shared/src/escape-html.ts, licensed
under the MIT License.

The character-level diff implementation (Services/FastDiff.cs) is a C# port of:

fast-diff
Copyright (c) Jason Chen <jhchen7@gmail.com>
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
https://github.com/jhchen/fast-diff

fast-diff itself modifies the diff-match-patch library by Neil Fraser.

The golden-test harness (tests/js-harness) bundles the TypeScript sources of
git-diff-view and fast-diff@1.3.0 with esbuild to generate reference data at
development time. These sources are test-only inputs and are not distributed
with the compiled libraries or NuGet packages.
